SUMMARY:39th ECNP Congress 2026
DESCRIPTION:The 39th ECNP Congress takes place October 10 to 13\, 2026\, 
 at the ICM in Munich. Abstract submission closed May 7\, 2026\, with no 
 late breaking track\, and standard fee registration remains open until O
 ctober 9\, 2026.\n\nDeadlines\nAbstract submission: 2026-05-07\nEarly fe
 e registration: 2026-05-20\nAbstract notification: 2026-07-15\nPresenter
  registration: 2026-07-22\nePoster and poster upload: 2026-09-08\nStanda
 rd fee registration: 2026-10-09\nOnsite registration closes: 2026-10-13\
 n\nhttps://www.ecnp.eu/congress2026/
LOCATION:Munich\, Bavaria\, DE\, ICM International Congress Center Messe 
 Muenchen
URL:https://www.ecnp.eu/congress2026/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:39th ECNP Congress 2026
TRIGGER:-P6DT15H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
